      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. User clicks on an add.\n2. our server recieve a request with an ad id.\n3. we process that ad id to update that specific ad click metric.\n4. we store the metric data in our db.\n5. that metric is available to the advertisers via api call. ",
