    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 338,
      "versionNonce": 1711628493,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "PPFNUpLWvSO9_tYGXQ1as",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 3707.236677416487,
      "y": 1730.4460165412472,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 803.90625,
      "height": 201.60000000000002,
      "seed": 807494723,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789725977517,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "In Kafka we will have a ad_id range based \npartition, and we can split the hot ad_id's\ninto different partitions by hashing them and \ndividing them into different 4-5 partitions.\nas the message just increases the count of an ad,\nthe order does not matter so it is safe. ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In Kafka we will have a ad_id range based \npartition, and we can split the hot ad_id's\ninto different partitions by hashing them and \ndividing them into different 4-5 partitions.\nas the message just increases the count of an ad,\nthe order does not matter so it is safe. ",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 195
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 474,
      "versionNonce": 1217649389,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "5-9YUDhhhmlD6VzBy18JX",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1627.236677416487,
      "y": 1871.2460165412472,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 705.46875,
      "height": 235.20000000000002,
      "seed": 2083727085,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789726297218,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Each request on click with contain a ad_id\nand a idempotency key that we will check \nalong with the user id and discard any \nduplicate records. we will keep track of \nthese keys and userid in redis kv pair and \non each request check the key in redis and \ndecide.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each request on click with contain a ad_id\nand a idempotency key that we will check \nalong with the user id and discard any \nduplicate records. we will keep track of \nthese keys and userid in redis kv pair and \non each request check the key in redis and \ndecide.",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 229
    },
